"line":84},{"w":"with","s":334.1,"e":334.59,"line":84},{"w":"me,","s":334.59,"e":334.95,"line":84},{"w":"Dad.","s":334.95,"e":335.44,"line":84},{"w":"I","s":335.44,"e":335.66,"line":85},{"w":"love","s":335.66,"e":336.1,"line":85},{"w":"you.","s":336.1,"e":336.54,"line":85}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":6.01,"text":"Up in the attic, where the afternoons would fly,"},{"s":6.01,"e":11.62,"text":"A microscope for little things, a telescope for the sky."},{"s":11.62,"e":17.63,"text":"I'd turn the knobs and wonder what was waiting there to see,"},{"s":17.63,"e":23.14,"text":"And you were always happy just to share it all with me."},{"s":23.14,"e":28.65,"text":"You had a mind that wandered where the mysteries begin,"},{"s":28.65,"e":34.46,"text":"From the tiniest living creature to the universe we're in."},{"s":34.46,"e":40.88,"text":"And looking back, those moments mean much more than I once knew,"},{"s":40.88,"e":46.49,"text":"Because every little discovery was another day with you."},{"s":46.49,"e":49.69,"text":"You never needed much attention,"},{"s":49.69,"e":52.1,"text":"Never needed to be loud."},{"s":52.1,"e":55.4,"text":"Just a gentle, thoughtful person,"},{"s":55.4,"e":58.21,"text":"And a dad who made me proud."},{"s":58.21,"e":62.32,"text":"Oh Dad, I love the way you saw the world,"},{"s":62.32,"e":66.62,"text":"All its little mysteries waiting to unfurl."},{"s":66.62,"e":69.73,"text":"You gave me something beautiful"},{"s":69.73,"e":71.93,"text":"In everything we'd do,"},{"s":71.93,"e":74.54,"text":"A thousand little memories"},{"s":74.54,"e":76.94,"text":"That always lead to you."},{"s":76.94,"e":80.55,"text":"And I hope you knew how much I loved"},{"s":80.55,"e":82.86,"text":"Just having you around."},{"s":82.86,"e":85.36,"text":"In a universe of wonders,"},{"s":85.36,"e":88.27,"text":"What a wonderful dad I found."},{"s":88.27,"e":93.88,"text":"You loved your prime numbers, the patterns in your head,"},{"s":93.88,"e":99.89,"text":"And the stories of Betelgeuse and all the things you'd read."},{"s":99.89,"e":106.3,"text":"You told me about quasars and the light they send through space,"},{"s":106.3,"e":112.81,"text":"And I loved to hear the excitement when a question came your way."},{"s":112.81,"e":118.42,"text":"Then we'd travel through Azeroth, another world to roam,"},{"s":118.42,"e":123.83,"text":"Or get lost in AVATAR MUD while sitting there at home."},{"s":123.83,"e":128.64,"text":"A scientist, a gamer, with so much on your mind,"},{"s":128.64,"e":135.66,"text":"But of all the things you loved to learn, you never forgot to be kind."},{"s":135.66,"e":139.26,"text":"You were patient, you were peaceful,"},{"s":139.26,"e":142.57,"text":"Always trying to do what's right."},{"s":142.57,"e":145.88,"text":"You could talk about the universe"},{"s":145.88,"e":149.68,"text":"And still make time for me that night."},{"s":149.68,"e":153.79,"text":"Oh Dad, I love the way you saw the world,"},{"s":153.79,"e":158.1,"text":"All its little mysteries waiting to unfurl."},{"s":158.1,"e":161.21,"text":"You gave me something beautiful"},{"s":161.21,"e":163.41,"text":"In everything we'd do,"},{"s":163.41,"e":166.01,"text":"A thousand little memories"},{"s":166.01,"e":168.42,"text":"That always lead to you."},{"s":168.42,"e":172.03,"text":"And I hope you knew how much I loved"},{"s":172.03,"e":174.33,"text":"Just having you around."},{"s":174.33,"e":176.84,"text":"In a universe of wonders,"},{"s":176.84,"e":179.74,"text":"What a wonderful dad I found."},{"s":179.74,"e":185.45,"text":"You drove me off to baseball, you drove me off to soccer,"},{"s":185.45,"e":190.26,"text":"Another afternoon, another game, another locker."},{"s":190.26,"e":195.77,"text":"And I don't remember every score or everything we said,"},{"s":195.77,"e":201.08,"text":"But I remember having you, and the happy life we led."},{"s":201.08,"e":205.99,"text":"It wasn't always science, it wasn't always space,"},{"s":205.99,"e":211.2,"text":"Sometimes it was just the two of us going someplace."},{"s":211.2,"e":216.91,"text":"And maybe that's what love is, when I think of you today,"},{"s":216.91,"e":222.22,"text":"All the ordinary little things you did along the way."},{"s":222.22,"e":225.43,"text":"I wish we had more time to talk,"},{"s":225.43,"e":228.43,"text":"More questions we could share."},{"s":228.43,"e":231.24,"text":"Another game, another laugh,"},{"s":231.24,"e":234.04,"text":"Another afternoon somewhere."},{"s":234.04,"e":237.25,"text":"I miss you, Dad, of course I do,"},{"s":237.25,"e":241.26,"text":"But there's so much that makes me smile."},{"s":241.26,"e":245.57,"text":"You filled my life with interesting things,"},{"s":245.57,"e":248.27,"text":"And made it all worthwhile."},{"s":248.27,"e":252.18,"text":"And if I could tell you one more thing,"},{"s":252.18,"e":255.49,"text":"Something simple, something true,"},{"s":255.49,"e":259.39,"text":"I'd say I'm really proud you're my dad,"},{"s":259.39,"e":262.6,"text":"And I loved growing up with you."},{"s":262.6,"e":266.71,"text":"Oh Dad, I love the way you saw the world,"},{"s":266.71,"e":271.12,"text":"Every tiny mystery, every star that swirled."},{"s":271.12,"e":274.22,"text":"You gave me all your curiosity,"},{"s":274.22,"e":277.03,"text":"Your patience and your care,"},{"s":277.03,"e":281.03,"text":"And every time I find something amazing,"},{"s":281.03,"e":283.74,"text":"I wish that you were there."},{"s":283.74,"e":287.35,"text":"You were brilliant, you were gentle,"},{"s":287.35,"e":290.35,"text":"You were wonderfully yourself."},{"s":290.35,"e":294.26,"text":"And there's no one else I'd rather have"},{"s":294.26,"e":297.06,"text":"Teaching me about the world."},{"s":297.06,"e":300.87,"text":"So here's to all the things we shared,"},{"s":300.87,"e":304.18,"text":"And everything you helped me see."},{"s":304.18,"e":307.48,"text":"You were a wonderful father, Dad,"},{"s":307.48,"e":310.49,"text":"And you meant the world to me."},{"s":310.49,"e":314.6,"text":"There's still so much left to figure out,"},{"s":314.6,"e":316.6,"text":"So many stars above."},{"s":316.6,"e":320.41,"text":"And every time I look a little closer,"},{"s":320.41,"e":323.31,"text":"I'll remember what you loved."},{"s":323.31,"e":327.42,"text":"From the smallest things beneath the lens"},{"s":327.42,"e":330.83,"text":"To the galaxies shining through..."},{"s":330.83,"e":335.44,"text":"Thank you for sharing your world with me, Dad."},{"s":335.44,"e":336.54,"text":"I love you."}],"duration":337.04,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}